      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have observed this same issue. I had turned on avatar cloning probably a week or two ago and then I noticed that it was still on, despite having \"auto disable avatar cloning\" enabled. This NEEDS to be fixed asap.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
