      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{610d538d5303a82960a415b4|full_name}: VRChat already supports multi-state (enum) buttons in many places, so it shouldn't be too hard. The only difficult thing is ensuring that it actually disables avatar cloning upon joining a new world.\n\nI would imagine it may be prone to the same issues, but at least if it is on the same property, it can probably be checked easier. Though IDK how their code is so I can't tell.",
